                    </p>
                    <p><hi rend="grantha">kṣatri</hi>ya-<hi rend="grantha">śikhā</hi>māṇi-vaḷanāṭṭu paṭṭiṉa-k-kūṟṟattu cōḻa-kula-valli-paṭiṉattu tirukkārōṇam-uṭaiyār Aḻaka-viṭaṅka-<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>var
                    </p>
                    
                    
